47:15.000 --> 47:26.000
And one of them was smoking a clay pipe and they had a [XX] hat on, 

47:26.000 --> 47:30.000
the two of them, and they were looking at the… 

47:30.000 --> 47:35.000
some tweed, they had tweet jackets on. 

47:36.000 --> 47:42.000
And the boat went anyway, lovely sailing down until she, 

47:42.000 --> 47:51.000
